; Gollum mutters about his pockets
;
; Script handler (op 3, in Gollum's script #R$CA14). When Gollum is where the
; player is, he says one of two things. A random number from 0 to 8 that is
; not negative (the carry left by #R$9C9F is clear), or Gollum holding the
; golden ring, gives "What has it got in its pockets ?"; otherwise (the ring is
; not with him) "My birthday present - how did we lose it. My precious".
; When he is elsewhere it returns before the test pass accepts, and the
; script takes its alternative step (#R$C9F7).
; .
; Hardware: none (the text goes through the message printer).
@label=GollumTalks
c$A926 LD A,($C4C1)  ; Gollum's location
 $A929 LD HL,$B6F5
 $A92C CP (HL)
 $A92D RET NZ        ; not together: refuse
 $A92E CALL $9D44
 $A931 LD HL,$B2D9   ; "What has it got in its pockets ?"
 $A934 LD A,$08      ; random 0 to 8
 $A936 CALL $9C9F
 $A939 JP NC,$A1E3   ; carry clear: say it
 $A93C LD IX,$C31A   ; the golden ring
@isub=LD A,CHR_GOLLUM
 $A940 LD A,$44
 $A942 CP (IX+$01)   ; held by Gollum?
 $A945 JP Z,$A1E3    ; yes: the same words
 $A948 LD HL,$B2E7   ; "My birthday present - how did we lose it. My precious"
 $A94B JP $A1E3
